# What the README's backup, restore and export commands leave (they run from deploy/) and the
# run guide's (from the clone's top folder): a folder per backup, a folder per restore that the
# restored cairn writes into, and the export copied out. Pinned by
# tests/unit/test_recovery_leaves_nothing_untracked_unit.py.
cairn-backup.*/
cairn-restore.*/
cairn-export.zip
